[color=#58D1B2][size=4][b]AI-Assisted Development[/b][/size][/color]
[color=#F3EEE7]AI tools were used as development and research assistants during the creation of AIM. The source code, implementation decisions, and final changes are reviewed, tested, and maintained by the project author.[/color]
[center][color=#58D1B2][size=4][b]Thank you for using AIM![/b][/size][/color][/center]
